# Hyperbolic functions

The hyperbolic sine, cosine and tangent are built in (`\sinh`, `\cosh`, `\tanh`, and `\mathrm{sech}`, `\mathrm{csch}`, `\coth`). This sheet gives their definitions, identities and inverse formulas. Import with `![[std/hyperbolic.mpp]]`.

## Definitions

Each is a combination of $e^x$ and $e^{-x}$.

$$ \sinh x \overset{?}{=} \frac{e^x - e^{-x}}{2} $$

$$ \cosh x \overset{?}{=} \frac{e^x + e^{-x}}{2} $$

$$ \tanh x \overset{?}{=} \frac{e^x - e^{-x}}{e^x + e^{-x}} $$

$$ \mathrm{sech}(x) \overset{?}{=} \frac{1}{\cosh x} $$

$$ \mathrm{csch}(x) \overset{?}{=} \frac{1}{\sinh x} $$

$$ \coth x \overset{?}{=} \frac{\cosh x}{\sinh x} $$

$$ \sinh 0 \overset{?}{=} 0 $$

$$ \cosh 0 \overset{?}{=} 1 $$

$$ \cosh(\ln 2) \overset{?}{=} \frac{5}{4} $$

## Identities

The hyperbolic Pythagorean identity: $(\cosh t, \sinh t)$ runs along the hyperbola $x^2 - y^2 = 1$.

$$ \cosh^2 x - \sinh^2 x \overset{?}{=} 1 $$

$$ 1 - \tanh^2 x \overset{?}{=} \mathrm{sech}(x)^2 $$

$$ \coth^2 x - 1 \overset{?}{=} \mathrm{csch}(x)^2 $$

Sums and doubles, like the trigonometric ones with some signs changed (Osborn's rule).

$$ \sinh(a + b) \overset{?}{=} \sinh a \cosh b + \cosh a \sinh b $$

$$ \cosh(a + b) \overset{?}{=} \cosh a \cosh b + \sinh a \sinh b $$

$$ \sinh(2x) \overset{?}{=} 2 \sinh x \cosh x $$

$$ \cosh(2x) \overset{?}{=} \cosh^2 x + \sinh^2 x $$

$$ \tanh(2x) \overset{?}{=} \frac{2 \tanh x}{1 + \tanh^2 x} $$

$$ \cosh x + \sinh x \overset{?}{=} e^x $$

Links with the circular functions through $i$.

$$ \cosh(i x) \overset{?}{=} \cos x $$

$$ \sinh(i x) \overset{?}{=} i \sin x $$

## Inverse functions

The inverses as logarithms.

$$ \operatorname{arsinh}(x) \overset{?}{=} \ln\left(x + \sqrt{x^2 + 1}\right) $$

$$ \operatorname{artanh}(\tfrac{1}{2}) \overset{?}{=} \frac{1}{2} \ln 3 $$

$$ \operatorname{arcosh}(2) \overset{?}{=} \ln\left(2 + \sqrt{3}\right) $$

The inverse hyperbolic cosine for $x \ge 1$, written out.

$$ \mathrm{arcoshlog}(x) := \ln\left(x + \sqrt{x^2 - 1}\right) $$

$$ \mathrm{arcoshlog}(\tfrac{5}{4}) \overset{?}{=} \ln 2 $$

The inverse hyperbolic tangent for $|x| < 1$, written out.

$$ \mathrm{artanhlog}(x) := \frac{1}{2} \ln\frac{1 + x}{1 - x} $$

$$ \mathrm{artanhlog}(\tfrac{3}{5}) \overset{?}{=} \ln 2 $$

$$ \tanh(\mathrm{artanhlog}(\tfrac{1}{3})) \overset{?}{=} \frac{1}{3} $$

## Derivatives

$$ \frac{d}{dx} \sinh x \overset{?}{=} \cosh x $$

$$ \frac{d}{dx} \cosh x \overset{?}{=} \sinh x $$

$$ \frac{d}{dx} \tanh x \overset{?}{=} \mathrm{sech}(x)^2 $$

$$ \frac{d}{dx} \operatorname{arsinh}(x) \overset{?}{=} \frac{1}{\sqrt{x^2 + 1}} $$
